# Specifications

One folder per feature: `docs/specs/<feature>/`, produced by the `/eco:*` spec pipeline.

| File | Produced by | Contents |
|---|---|---|
| `intake.md` | `/eco:intake` | Raw facts from BRDs, notes and Figma, each citing its source |
| `questions.md` | `/eco:clarify` | Interview log: question, answer, who answered, date |
| `spec.md` | `/eco:spec` | Requirements with REQ-IDs and acceptance criteria |
| `nfr.md` | `/eco:spec` | Non-functional requirements with numeric targets |
| `data-catalog.md` | `/eco:spec` | Every data field with PII class, purpose, consent basis, retention |
| `hld.md`, `lld.md`, `integration.md` | `/eco:design` | Design documents |
| `api/openapi.yaml` | `/eco:design` | API contract |
| `tasks.md` | `/eco:plan` | Work items, pushed to GitLab issues |
| `uat.md` | `/eco:uat` | UAT cases, at least one per REQ-ID |
| `trace.md` | generated | REQ → design → issue → test → UAT result |
